      "fact": "Tool 'send_certificate' requires a valid user_id and amount, but does not validate compensation eligibility."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "h18",
      "actor": "user",
      "role": "confirmation",
      "fact": "User confirms reservation WUNA5K as the affected business flight."
    }
  ],
  "exception_analysis": "No exceptions apply. The user is a regular member (not silver/gold), lacks travel insurance for the affected reservation, and the flight was not business class. Additionally, the user did not explicitly request compensation in the current interaction; they only reiterated their claim and frustration. The assistant did not confirm the cancellation status with the user before proceeding with compensation.",
